  "description": "JOYSTAR Petal Series Girls' Bike - Sizes 12\" to 20\"\nEmpower your child's journey with the JOYSTAR Petal Girls’ Bike. Expertly engineered for riders aged 3-10, this bike blends rugged durability with child-friendly ergonomics to create the ultimate first riding experience.\n\nPremium design meets safety: The JOYSTAR Petal Series.\n\nEngineering Excellence & Safety\n\n\"Built for maximum enjoyment and safety, the JOYSTAR Petal is designed to survive the learning process and inspire confidence.\"\n\nHardcore Sturdy Design\nThe Hi-Ten steel frame and fork provide exceptional impact resistance when navigating rocky or bumpy terrain. This \"hardcore\" build ensures the bike survives the multiple bumps of learning balance while maintaining its structural integrity.\n\nAll-terrain rubber tires provide outstanding grip in any weather.\n\nAdvanced Safety Features\n\nIntuitive Braking: Easy-to-use coaster brakes (pedal back to stop) for phenomenal stopping power.\n\nFull Chain Protection: Enclosed guard keeps fingers and clothing safe.\n\nRemovable Training Wheels: Heavy-duty support for beginners.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nThe JOYSTAR Petal arrives 85% pre-assembled. We provide the tools and a simple guide to get your child riding in no time.\n\nWatch: Simple assembly guide to get you rolling fast.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nSee It In Action\n\nSmooth pedaling and easy handling for little thrill-seekers.\n\nOur Guarantee\nEvery JOYSTAR bike is backed by our Limited Lifetime Warranty and timely customer service. We include DIY decal stickers and streamers so every ride is unique.",
